{"attributes":{"description":"SOC Lab – Incident Response Dashboard\n\nDesigned for active incident investigation. Narrow the time range to the incident window (e.g., 2-hour period around the alert) for maximum focus.\n\nInvestigation workflow:\n  1. Set time range to the suspected incident window\n  2. Event Timeline: identify which event categories spiked and when\n  3. Source IPs: identify the attacker's origin IP(s)\n  4. Processes: look for unusual binaries, LOL binaries (wmic, mshta, certutil), or known attack tools\n  5. Users: identify which accounts were active — correlate with authentication events\n  6. Network Ports: identify C2 channels (unusual ports), lateral movement (445, 3389), or exfiltration\n  7. Click any value to filter the entire dashboard to that entity\n\nImport instructions:\n  Kibana → Stack Management → Saved Objects → Import → select this file","hits":0,"kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"query\":{\"language\":\"kuery\",\"query\":\"\"},\"filter\":[]}"},"optionsJSON":"{\"useMargins\":true,\"syncColors\":false,\"hidePanelTitles\":false}","panelsJSON":"[{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"w\":48,\"h\":12,\"i\":\"panel-0\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-0\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_0\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":12,\"w\":12,\"h\":18,\"i\":\"panel-1\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-1\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_1\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":12,\"y\":12,\"w\":12,\"h\":18,\"i\":\"panel-2\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-2\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_2\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":24,\"y\":12,\"w\":12,\"h\":18,\"i\":\"panel-3\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-3\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_3\"},{\"version\":\